{"id":"d71c15e0342b2318","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Natural Isomorphism","display":"df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism — ZFC Cat2 Natural Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism — ZFC Cat2 Natural Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-natural-isomorphism — ZFC Cat2 Natural Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"610f23ee04365803\" href=\"?note=610f23ee04365803\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-morphism.md\">../batch17/58-df-morphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\">\\(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"610f23ee04365803\" href=\"?note=610f23ee04365803\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-morphism.md\">../batch17/58-df-morphism.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}natural\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C},\nD_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D},\nF_0,F_1,G_0,G_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D}\\rangle\\land\nF=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land G=\\langle G_0,G_1\\rangle\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S(\\eta(X),F_0(X),G_0(X),\\mathcal D)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}natural\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2NaturalIsomorphism}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C},\nD_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D},\nF_0,F_1,G_0,G_1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\land\n\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D}\\rangle\\land\nF=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land G=\\langle G_0,G_1\\rangle\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S(\\eta(X),F_0(X),G_0(X),\\mathcal D)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自然同构显式解包函子对象映射与源范畴载体；分量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta(X)\">\\(\\eta(X)\\)</span>，而不是把函子编码本身误当函数调用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-morphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"610f23ee04365803","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5$（see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-morphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"610f23ee04365803","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Isomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^4$（see [[../batch17/58-df-morphism.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{